# Named Analyst Project Frame

The named analyst is the research lead.

The caller supports the project.

Preferred language:

"I'm reaching out on behalf of my colleague, [ANALYST NAME]."

"[ANALYST NAME] is leading research in the [INDUSTRY] market."

"I'm part of the research team supporting that work."

"My role is really to give you some context around the process and help coordinate the next conversation with [ANALYST NAME]."

Never invent analyst involvement.
